buffer refused": the kernel returned kIOReturnNoMemory with no log line, i.e. from the descriptor or the
createMappingInTask(kernel_task) of 0156. CoreAnimation's image and glyph memory then took another
upload path (and came out flipped). The pages are pushed out of the cache through the physical map
(phystokv of each wired segment) at import and before every submission that names them; no kernel
mapping is made.

